{% doc %}
  @prompt
    PROMPT FOR SHOPIFY AI:
    Create a product stack overview section with centered header and two-column product cards:
    HEADER SECTION (Full Width, Centered):
    
    Main headline:
    
    Lightning bolt icon (⚡) before text
    "THE ANTI-AGING STACK THAT ACTUALLY WORKS"
    Font-size: 36px
    Font-weight: 700 (bold)
    Color: black (#1a1a1a)
    Text-align: center
    Margin-bottom: 15px
    
    
    Subheading:
    
    "Think of your cells like batteries. This protocol recharges them using 3 proven ingredients backed by 200+ scientific studies."
    Font-size: 18px
    Color: dark gray (#555)
    Text-align: center
    Line-height: 1.6
    Max-width: 900px
    Centered
    Margin-bottom: 50px
    
    
    
    PRODUCT CARDS SECTION:
    Create a two-column grid with an orange plus sign (+) between cards:
    Each Card Structure:
    
    Image placeholder:
    
    Dashed border container (#ccc, 2px dashed)
    Aspect ratio: 4:3
    Background: light gray (#f5f5f5)
    Centered text with camera icon:
    
    Card 1: "📷 [BOTTLE 1 IMAGE] / NAD+ COMPLEX"
    Card 2: "📷 [BOTTLE 2 IMAGE] / NMN + RESVERATROL"
    
    
    Height: 280px
    Margin-bottom: 25px
    
    
    Product title:
    
    Card 1: "BOTTLE 1: NAD+ COMPLEX"
    Card 2: "BOTTLE 2: NMN STACK"
    Font-size: 22px
    Font-weight: 700 (bold)
    Color: black (#1a1a1a)
    Margin-bottom: 15px
    
    
    "What it does:" section:
    
    Label: "What it does:" (bold)
    Card 1 description: "Recharges your cells for sustained energy."
    Card 2 description: "Activates your longevity genes."
    Font-size: 16px
    Line-height: 1.5
    Margin-bottom: 20px
    
    
    Ingredients list (bullets):
    
    Standard bullet points (•)
    Font-size: 16px
    Line-height: 1.8
    Color: dark gray (#333)
    Padding-left: 20px
    
    Card 1 bullets:
    
    NAD+ boosters
    Resveratrol ("red wine molecule")
    CoQ10 (heart health)
    
    Card 2 bullets:
    
    NMN (anti-aging)
    Extra Resveratrol
    Quercetin (recovery)
    Margin-bottom: 20px
    
    
    Supply information:
    
    "180 capsules · 3-month supply"
    Font-size: 14px
    Color: medium gray (#777)
    Margin-top: auto (push to bottom of card)
    
    
    
    PLUS SIGN DIVIDER:
    
    Large orange plus sign (+) between the two cards
    Font-size: 48px
    Color: orange (#e67e22)
    Vertically centered between cards
    Position: absolute center between columns
    
    CARD STYLING:
    
    White background (#ffffff)
    Border-radius: 12px
    Padding: 30px
    Box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.08)
    Display: flex, flex-direction: column
    Min-height: 600px (ensures equal card heights)
    
    DESKTOP LAYOUT (768px and above):
    
    Container max-width: 1200px, centered
    Padding: 80px 40px
    Background: light gray (#f7f7f7)
    Two-column grid: 45% card, 10% divider space, 45% card
    Gap between cards: 40px (with plus sign in middle)
    
    MOBILE-SPECIFIC PARAMETERS (767px and below):
    
    Layout: Single column, stacked vertically
    Padding: 40px 20px
    Header headline: 28px (reduce from 36px)
    Header subheading: 16px (reduce from 18px)
    Card min-height: Auto (remove fixed height)
    Image placeholder height: 220px (reduce from 280px)
    Product title: 20px (reduce from 22px)
    "What it does" text: 15px (reduce from 16px)
    Ingredients list: 15px (reduce from 16px)
    Supply info: 13px (reduce from 14px)
    Card padding: 25px 20px (reduce from 30px)
    Plus sign:
    
    Rotate 90 degrees (becomes vertical divider)
    OR display between cards horizontally
    Font-size: 36px (reduce from 48px)
    Margin: 20px 0 (vertical spacing)
    
    
    Cards: Full width (100%)
    Gap between cards: 30px
    
    TABLET PARAMETERS (768px - 1024px):
    
    Maintain two-column layout
    Reduce card padding to 25px
    Font sizes: reduce by 10% from desktop
    Container padding: 60px 30px
    
    STYLING REQUIREMENTS:
    
    Cards should have equal heights on desktop (use flexbox or CSS grid)
    Hover effect on cards: slight shadow increase and lift (desktop only)
    Smooth transitions on hover (0.3s ease)
    Clean, minimal design with consistent spacing
    Plus sign should be visually prominent
    
    FUNCTIONALITY & SECTION SETTINGS:
    
    Make cards editable/repeatable through section settings
    Each card should allow:
    
    Image upload
    Title text field
    "What it does" description
    Ingredient list (repeater field for bullet points)
    Supply information text
    
    
    Option to add/remove cards (support 2-4 cards)
    Color pickers for accent colors (plus sign, etc.)
    Toggle for card shadow/hover effects
    
    ACCESSIBILITY:
    
    Use semantic HTML (section, article tags for cards)
    Proper heading hierarchy (h2 for main headline, h3 for card titles)
    Alt text for product images
    Sufficient color contrast
    Keyboard navigation support for interactive elements
    
    RESPONSIVE BREAKPOINTS:
    
    Mobile: max-width 767px (single column, vertical plus sign)
    Tablet: 768px - 1024px (2 columns, scaled)
    Desktop: 1025px+ (full 2-column with centered plus sign)
    
    BOTTOM BORDER:
    
    Full-width horizontal line (1px solid #ddd) at bottom of section
    Margin-top: 60px (desktop), 40px (mobile)
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-stack-overview-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding: 80px 40px 60px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-stack-overview-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-stack-overview-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 50px;
  }

  .ai-stack-overview-headline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.headline_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.headline_color }};
    margin: 0 0 15px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .ai-stack-overview-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-right: 8px;
  }

  .ai-stack-overview-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subheading_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.subheading_color }};
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-stack-overview-cards-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .ai-stack-overview-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 30px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, {{ block.settings.card_shadow_opacity }});
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-height: 600px;
    transition: box-shadow 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .ai-stack-overview-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
      {% if block.settings.enable_hover_effect %}
        box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, {{ block.settings.card_shadow_opacity | times: 1.5 }});
        transform: translateY(-4px);
      {% endif %}
    }
  }

  .ai-stack-overview-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    border: 2px dashed {{ block.settings.placeholder_border_color }};
    background-color: {{ block.settings.placeholder_background }};
    border-radius: 8px;
    height: {{ block.settings.image_height }}px;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-stack-overview-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-stack-overview-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 60%;
    height: 60%;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .ai-stack-overview-placeholder-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.placeholder_text_color }};
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .ai-stack-overview-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.card_title_size }}px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.card_title_color }};
    margin: 0 0 15px;
  }

  .ai-stack-overview-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.description_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .ai-stack-overview-description-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .ai-stack-overview-ingredients-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    list-style-type: disc;
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
  }

  .ai-stack-overview-ingredients-{{ ai_gen_id }} li {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.ingredients_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .ai-stack-overview-supply-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.supply_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.supply_color }};
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .ai-stack-overview-divider-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.divider_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.divider_color }};
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .ai-stack-overview-bottom-border-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    border-bottom: 1px solid {{ block.settings.bottom_border_color }};
    margin-top: 60px;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 1024px) and (min-width: 768px) {
    .ai-stack-overview-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 60px 30px 40px;
    }

    .ai-stack-overview-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 25px;
    }

    .ai-stack-overview-headline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: calc({{ block.settings.headline_size }}px * 0.9);
    }

    .ai-stack-overview-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: calc({{ block.settings.subheading_size }}px * 0.9);
    }

    .ai-stack-overview-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: calc({{ block.settings.card_title_size }}px * 0.9);
    }

    .ai-stack-overview-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: calc({{ block.settings.description_size }}px * 0.9);
    }

    .ai-stack-overview-ingredients-{{ ai_gen_id }} li {
      font-size: calc({{ block.settings.ingredients_size }}px * 0.9);
    }

    .ai-stack-overview-supply-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: calc({{ block.settings.supply_size }}px * 0.9);
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 767px) {
    .ai-stack-overview-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }

    .ai-stack-overview-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .ai-stack-overview-headline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    .ai-stack-overview-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .ai-stack-overview-cards-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 30px;
    }

    .ai-stack-overview-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 25px 20px;
      min-height: auto;
    }

    .ai-stack-overview-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      height: 220px;
    }

    .ai-stack-overview-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .ai-stack-overview-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .ai-stack-overview-ingredients-{{ ai_gen_id }} li {
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .ai-stack-overview-supply-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .ai-stack-overview-divider-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 36px;
      transform: rotate(90deg);
    }

    .ai-stack-overview-bottom-border-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      margin-top: 40px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-stack-overview-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-stack-overview-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-stack-overview-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <h2 class="ai-stack-overview-headline-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <span class="ai-stack-overview-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.headline_icon }}</span>
        {{ block.settings.headline }}
      </h2>
      <div class="ai-stack-overview-subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {{ block.settings.subheading }}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ai-stack-overview-cards-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <article class="ai-stack-overview-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-stack-overview-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.card_1_image %}
            <img
              src="{{ block.settings.card_1_image | image_url: width: 600 }}"
              alt="{{ block.settings.card_1_image.alt | escape }}"
              loading="lazy"
              width="600"
              height="{{ block.settings.image_height }}"
            >
          {% else %}
            {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
            <div class="ai-stack-overview-placeholder-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.card_1_placeholder_text }}
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>

        <h3 class="ai-stack-overview-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.card_1_title }}
        </h3>

        <div class="ai-stack-overview-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <span class="ai-stack-overview-description-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">What it does:</span>
          {{ block.settings.card_1_description }}
        </div>

        <ul class="ai-stack-overview-ingredients-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.card_1_ingredient_1 != blank %}
            <li>{{ block.settings.card_1_ingredient_1 }}</li>
          {% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.card_1_ingredient_2 != blank %}
            <li>{{ block.settings.card_1_ingredient_2 }}</li>
          {% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.card_1_ingredient_3 != blank %}
            <li>{{ block.settings.card_1_ingredient_3 }}</li>
          {% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.card_1_ingredient_4 != blank %}
            <li>{{ block.settings.card_1_ingredient_4 }}</li>
          {% endif %}
        </ul>

        <div class="ai-stack-overview-supply-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.card_1_supply }}
        </div>
      </article>

      <div class="ai-stack-overview-divider-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {{ block.settings.divider_symbol }}
      </div>

      <article class="ai-stack-overview-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-stack-overview-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.card_2_image %}
            <img
              src="{{ block.settings.card_2_image | image_url: width: 600 }}"
              alt="{{ block.settings.card_2_image.alt | escape }}"
              loading="lazy"
              width="600"
              height="{{ block.settings.image_height }}"
            >
          {% else %}
            {{ 'product-2' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
            <div class="ai-stack-overview-placeholder-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.card_2_placeholder_text }}
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>

        <h3 class="ai-stack-overview-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.card_2_title }}
        </h3>

        <div class="ai-stack-overview-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <span class="ai-stack-overview-description-label-{{ ai_gen_id }}">What it does:</span>
          {{ block.settings.card_2_description }}
        </div>

        <ul class="ai-stack-overview-ingredients-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.card_2_ingredient_1 != blank %}
            <li>{{ block.settings.card_2_ingredient_1 }}</li>
          {% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.card_2_ingredient_2 != blank %}
            <li>{{ block.settings.card_2_ingredient_2 }}</li>
          {% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.card_2_ingredient_3 != blank %}
            <li>{{ block.settings.card_2_ingredient_3 }}</li>
          {% endif %}
          {% if block.settings.card_2_ingredient_4 != blank %}
            <li>{{ block.settings.card_2_ingredient_4 }}</li>
          {% endif %}
        </ul>

        <div class="ai-stack-overview-supply-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.card_2_supply }}
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="ai-stack-overview-bottom-border-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
  </div>
</div>

